    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "JX-08 Reference Manual, MIDI Implementation Chart (version 1.00, Oct. 13, 2021)",
      "notes": "Control Change list read by tools/profiles/roland/read-cc-list.mjs from JX-08_reference_eng01_W.pdf, page 62 (sha256 9a8c545e9c23cc2dd837f11fab8712552a1a485cc46835a9cb32c98628f9b82e), https://static.roland.com/assets/media/pdf/JX-08_reference_eng01_W.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/roland/make-cc-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/roland/cc-synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a controller the manual lists, on the number it gives, with the name it prints. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Roland prints no value ranges for these controllers, so each is 0 - 127 on the wire unless a note below says the manual prints otherwise; a switch is a number until the instrument shows where its positions fall.",
    "CC 21 is named \"DCO-1 ENV MOD\": printed \"DCO-1 ENEV MOD\", a misprint of ENV (CC 63 is DCO-2 ENV)"
  ],
